[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778452123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104932#issuecomment-2778452123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104932","id":2778452123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lm9Cb","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T11:42:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T11:42:28Z","body":"It isn't related to typed dictionaries, also it may be reproducible in 4.3 too, just we need to confirm it, hope it gets fixed before having more duplicated issues like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104861 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104952. It took me like 30 mins to search the whole project to find this issue, and i expect that many other projects may suffer from it but they may not easily address the bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778452123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3101975816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104932#issuecomment-3101975816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104932","id":3101975816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc645GUI","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T10:00:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T10:00:01Z","body":"I couldn't reproduce this by following the steps with a new project, but I could with the MRP. It is caused by the `_init` function not having default values for the param. Seems that is causing an error which is preventing the Resource from being properly instantiated and applied to the Node. If we do the same thing to the Node's script, then it doesn't end up having the script attached to it in the scene.\n\nSeems that nodes and resources that become instantiated by a scene should not have _init functions without default params. This definitely needs to be more clearly communicated.\n\nI will investigate the engine code in more detail, and report back should I find anything to determine whether this is a bug, or a case of poorly communicated behaviour. (I feel that it should at least be pausing execution and highlighting the `_init` function)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3101975816/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106395905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104932#issuecomment-3106395905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104932","id":3106395905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65J9cB","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T08:06:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T08:07:48Z","body":"Looks to be a case of poor communication and error handling.\n\nRelated issues:\n#108266\n#102902 \n\nSolution:\n* Add a supressable warning to GDScript to highlight `_init` functions on classes that extend from Node or Resource that contain required params. This warning should explain this behaviour, and stipulate that these objects can only be instantiated through code.\n* Display a warning when creating instances of such classes (in the scene/inspector).\n* Display a warning for any existing instances of such classes (in the scene/inspector).\n* Display a warning for any code written to `duplicate` such classes.\n* (Maybe) prevent loading of any scenes or resources that are/contain such classes.\n* (Optimally) pause execution and highlight the offending `_init` function if attempting to execute them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106395905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554702845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104932#issuecomment-4554702845","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104932","id":4554702845,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD3s__Q","user":{"login":"supernovafiles","id":67494190,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDk0MTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67494190?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles","html_url":"https://github.com/supernovafiles","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supernovafiles/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T12:59:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T13:35:20Z","body":"Hi everyone!\n\nI believe I have a similar case where the values of a typed dictionary are reset in the editor after you leave the scene tab. It seems some types of objects return this behavior. In my case, it happened with an enum from a custom class and `AnimationLibrary`. For example, `var animation_libraries: Dictionary[Item.ItemType, AnimationLibrary]`.\n\nEDIT: It seems to happen with any type.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4554702845/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]